    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γειτον-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>neighbourship</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πικρὰ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					843c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1395b9
			</span></i>; <i>neighbouring region</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.4.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>quarter, ward</i>, in a city, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				7.4.1
			</span></i>:— hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γειτον-ίαρχος</span></b> , ὁ, <i>chief
				official of a ward</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεγεονάριος</span>
			.</div>
